 your organization meet regulatory requirements and industry standards.</p><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="250" class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-euro-200 bg-euro-50/50"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">What is Lifts Directive?</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The Lifts Directive (2014/33/EU) ensures that lifts and lifting equipment placed on the EU market meet essential health and safety requirements. It covers passenger lifts, goods lifts, service lifts, lifting platforms, and safety components for lifts.</p></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_32px_80px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] border border-slate-100 h-[350px] sm:h-[450px] md:h-[550px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367986/eurocert/c3.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="Lifts Certification"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/30 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Comprehensive Services</h4><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Service Nodes</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="0" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Certification &amp; Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full scope verification for Lifts Directive (2014/33/EU) requirements and safety compliance.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive safety assessment and technical file evaluation for all lift types.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="200" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all duration-500 group"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-6 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-xl"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert coaching on lifts safety requirements and technical documentation standards.</p></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="300" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:bord